subgroup problem [4]. If the parameters of t-MDLP don’t satisfy two  conditions in Theorem 3, Shor’s quantum 
algorithm will reduce the solving difficulty, i.e the quantum algorithm for the hidden subgroup problem can also do. 
Thus the two conditions in Theorem 3 are also the necessary conditions of which t-MDLP resists the quantum 
algorithm for the hidden subgroup. 
5 Conclusion 
In this paper, t-MDLP is presented, whose solving difficulty is analyzed. Ant t wo necessary conditions of 
resisting the quantum algorithm for the hidden subgroup are given. Based on the problem, designing the public-key 
crypto is worth further studying. 
