+        "turns the multiplicative t-MDLP equation into a linear congruence"
+    ),
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "decomposition",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Subtracting the identity exposes a rank-one matrix, whereas missing "
+        "that decomposition leaves dense elimination or thousands of scalar trials."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: dense Gauss-Jordan elimination over F_q solves the promised "
