+"""Verified Track-B generator for the t-multiple discrete logarithm problem.
+
+The group is a CRT product of prime-field subgroups of common prime order q.
+An instance is emitted in the exact logarithmic coordinate system used in
+Section 4, equations (3)--(4), of arXiv:1605.04870. Generation samples the
+exponent witness first and applies an invertible rank-one perturbation; it
+never solves the emitted instance.
