codex
The official harness produced all three transcript files, but every call in all arms was an HTTP 403 redraw; none is counted as an oracle attempt. Final local verification is clean: deterministic generation, silent import, parsing round-trip, verifier independence from `inst["answer"]`, and hint-mode behavior all pass. The only failing gate is G9 because the required external evidence cannot be obtained with the current key.
